u _ j\in \mathcal A_\varphi (F_ j)$, then $
u _ j$ converges weakly to that probability. Proof. For $h\in C(X,\mathbb R)$ define the width \[  w_ h(F)=\max _{
u \in \mathcal A_\varphi (F)}\int _ Xh\, \mathrm{d}
